## 🌐 Language Profiles (Auto-Detection)

Language-specific rules are automatically applied based on project files.

### Detection Logic

| File Detected | Profile Activated | Description |
|---------------|-------------------|-------------|
| `package.json` | `profiles/typescript.md` | TypeScript/React/Next.js rules |
| `Cargo.toml` | `profiles/rust.md` | Rust rules |
| `pyproject.toml` | `profiles/python.md` | Python rules |
| `go.mod` | `profiles/go.md` | Go rules |

### TypeScript Profile (`profiles/typescript.md`):
- TypeScript strict mode

### Rust Profile (`profiles/rust.md`):
- Never Panics principle
- Result<T, Error> everywhere
- RAII memory management
- Property-based testing (proptest)
- Clippy/Miri static analysis

### Multi-Language Projects
When multiple config files exist (e.g., Tauri app with both `Cargo.toml` and `package.json`), all matching profiles are activated.

